<?xml version="1.0" standalone="yes"?>
<TestimonialsDS xmlns="http://tempuri.org/TestimonialsDS.xsd">
  <xs:schema id="TestimonialsDS" targetNamespace="http://tempuri.org/TestimonialsDS.xsd" xmlns:mstns="http://tempuri.org/TestimonialsDS.xsd" xmlns="http://tempuri.org/TestimonialsDS.xsd" xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:msdata="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:xml-msdata" attributeFormDefault="qualified" elementFormDefault="qualified">
    <xs:element name="TestimonialsDS" msdata:IsDataSet="true" msdata:UseCurrentLocale="true">
      <xs:complexType>
        <xs:choice minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
          <xs:element name="Testimonials">
            <xs:complexType>
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="Id" msdata:ReadOnly="true" msdata:AutoIncrement="true" msdata:AutoIncrementSeed="1" type="xs:int" />
                <xs:element name="Text" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0" />
                <xs:element name="From" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0" />
                <xs:element name="Info" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0" />
                <xs:element name="Approved" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0" />
                <xs:element name="Display" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0" />
                <xs:element name="GroupId" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0" />
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:complexType>
          </xs:element>
          <xs:element name="Groups">
            <xs:complexType>
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="GroupId" msdata:ReadOnly="true" msdata:AutoIncrement="true" msdata:AutoIncrementSeed="1" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0" />
                <xs:element name="GroupName" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0" />
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:complexType>
          </xs:element>
        </xs:choice>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:unique name="Constraint1" msdata:PrimaryKey="true">
        <xs:selector xpath=".//mstns:Testimonials" />
        <xs:field xpath="mstns:Id" />
      </xs:unique>
      <xs:unique name="Groups_Constraint1" msdata:ConstraintName="Constraint1">
        <xs:selector xpath=".//mstns:Groups" />
        <xs:field xpath="mstns:GroupId" />
      </xs:unique>
    </xs:element>
  </xs:schema>
  <Testimonials>
    <Id>1</Id>
    <Text>I wish to take a moment to thank you for the great opportunity to teach at SABIS® in Erbil this past spring! I must say, the experience has shaped me as a teacher and given me a brand new perspective on my career. After gaining some valuable experience at SABIS®, I have decided to pursue a masters of education and also my state licensure to teach elementary school. In all honesty, I can't wait to return to SABIS® (Erbil hopefully) in a year or two. I miss my students very much and still keep in contact with several of them! I also miss the professional development and mentoring that was given to me by great educators, leaders and friends.</Text>
    <From>SABIS® Teacher</From>
    <Info></Info>
    <Approved>1</Approved>
    <Display>1</Display>
    <GroupId>1</GroupId>
  </Testimonials>
  <Testimonials>
    <Id>2</Id>
    <Text>The International School of Choueifat has done a tremendous job in Kurdistan by delivering quality education to its students. The skills being imparted to and embedded in the youngsters are clearly visible. This is very important for the future of Kurdistan, especially as these young students are being encouraged and developed to be the future leaders of Kurdistan.</Text>
    <From>Karim Sinjari</From>
    <Info></Info>
    <Approved>1</Approved>
    <Display>1</Display>
    <GroupId>1</GroupId>
  </Testimonials>
  <Testimonials>
    <Id>3</Id>
    <Text>Choueifat brought about a great change in my daughter. She learned to take over more responsibilities, transformed into a hardworking person, and above all, developed a desire to help other students. We are thankful for the school and for the difference it has made in the life of my child and other children.</Text>
    <From>Naznaz</From>
    <Info></Info>
    <Approved>1</Approved>
    <Display>1</Display>
    <GroupId>1</GroupId>
  </Testimonials>
  <Testimonials>
    <Id>4</Id>
    <Text>The SABIS Student Life Organization® instills confidence, builds communication skills, and encourages us to participate and demonstrate leadership abilities. One day, we hope to lead and serve our country as ministers, prime ministers, and other influential dignitaries.</Text>
    <From>ISC-Erbil Head Prefect</From>
    <Info></Info>
    <Approved>1</Approved>
    <Display>1</Display>
    <GroupId>1</GroupId>
  </Testimonials>
  <Testimonials>
    <Id>5</Id>
    <Text>From a social perspective, Choueifat has done a great job in developing students’ social skills, confidence, and ability to communicate with people.</Text>
    <From>Shireen Ehmedi</From>
    <Info></Info>
    <Approved>1</Approved>
    <Display>1</Display>
    <GroupId>2</GroupId>
  </Testimonials>

  <Groups>
    <GroupId>1</GroupId>
    <GroupName>Parent Testimonials</GroupName>
  </Groups>
  <Groups>
    <GroupId>2</GroupId>
    <GroupName>Student Testimonials</GroupName>
  </Groups>
</TestimonialsDS>